      "message": "Here is the concrete failure case:\n    hardware: 8cpus, boot cpu0 support 32bit el0, secondary cpu4 not support 32bit el0.\n    a. if `allow_mismatched_32bit_el0` is false. current cpu4 is reject to online since it will fail the verify.\n    b. if `allow_mismatched_32bit_el01 is true, secondary cpu4 is allowed to online and not do any verify_local_elf_hwcaps.\n\nif we only check the per cpu reg id to decide verify_local_elf_hwcaps, the software control flag of allow_mismatched_32bit_el0 will not working as it is now.\n\nfor ARM64_HAS_32BIT_EL0, are you talking about ARM64_HAS_32BIT_EL0_DO_NOT_USE (sysreg SYS_ID_AA64PFR0_EL1 )? Will it prevent the cpu4 online in the example above?",
